{
  "id": "68",
  "title": "弃命从杀论",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“弃命从杀论”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙无根，怕逢申酉；杀合逢之，双目必朽。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-17245d1e814afa1ad32a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲木无根，生于丑月；水多转贵，金土则折。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-708778a5302da767aa86-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙木酉月，见水为奇；有根丑绝，无根寅危。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-035a4e343f895e2f387a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙木坐酉，庚丁透露；二库归根，孤神得失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-fc7709ea4e1d10d10149-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙火申提，无根从杀；有根南旺，脱根寿促。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-d8845d41a433ec222648-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳火无根，水乡必忌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-0ca48923343250e97c37-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴火无根，水乡有救。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-2c654356e2b2126faf52-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴火酉月，弃命就财；北方入格，南则为灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-3c4826de806a8f22dc4b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊己亥月，身弱为弃；卯月同推，嫌根劫比。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-2c24fb93850da451a119-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚金无根，寅宫火局；南方有贵，须防寿促。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-46f3e102c35be25073f4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛巳阴柔，休囚官杀；运限加金，聪明显达。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-76d8aa4e0269564771f6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬日戌提，癸干未月；运喜东方，逢冲则绝。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-92ba06f3d3edee7cfc85-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "弃命从财，须要会财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-50523f9a6e596dbe100e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "弃命从杀，须要会杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-596b9682163fd08a084d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "从财忌杀；从杀喜财；命逢根气，命殞无猜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "68-4015154ea247d5340974-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
